 muon trap what she doesn't yet know  is that the trap contains a demon that  could bring about the end of the world a  demon her grandfather sacrificed his  life to contain so naturally she takes  the trap to school to be examined by her  teacher gary gruberson yes that's his  real name they along with phoebe's  friend podcast attempt to open the trap  not knowing it contains one of the two  demons needed to awaken gozer now here's  where it gets a bit complicated if you  haven't seen the original films gozer is  the main villain but in order to awaken  her you need her two minions the key  master and the gatekeeper which take the  form of these weird-looking dogs who can  also inhabit the bodies of humans only  when these two entities are together and  placed on a conduit like the top of the  central park apartments in ghostbusters  1 or the chandra mine and afterlaff can  gozer be summoned if one of these  minions were to be trapped or killed  gozer can't resurrect so when phoebe and  gary unknowingly release this minion  that was trapped by egon they've set in  motion a sequence of events which lead  to the end of the world but not to worry  egon has planned for this within the  mind lays a giant hole which contains  gozer and her demonic army every once in  a while the demons attempt to escape  causing these unexplained earthquakes  around somerville but egon had set up  multiple particle throwers those guns  the ghostbusters use to keep the demons  at bay should they attempt to escape and  this seems to have worked for some time  that is until the key master in demon  dog form takes control of paul rudd's  character and he destroys the particle  throwers allowing hundreds of demons to  terrorize the earth for those of you who  have seen the movie you'll also have  noticed two interesting things about the  shandor mine one are the sequence of  numbers surrounding the ruins which  depict major events the kids refer to  this as a prophecy for example here are  a list of huge events that it predicted  in the year 1883 it predicted the  krakatoa eruption in 1908 the tunguska  event which saw a meteor explode in  siberia flattening over 80 million trees  but more importantly there is 1984 which  were the events of the original  ghostbusters and now there's 2021.  something happens this year that could  cause terrible destruction but even  creepier than these prophetic numbers is  the corpse of evo shandor himself  something about his body being next to  this demonic hole has preserved it and  every time the hole erupts it brings him  to life for a few seconds and it's only  when the demons eventually do get  released that evo is resurrected back to  life fun fact evo is played by jk  simmons who has appeared in every one of  jason reitman's movies this is a really  minor role since a few minutes into his  resurrection he's ironically killed by  gozer the entity he so desperately tried  to resurrect while this is all going on  cali uncovers her father's secret lab  remember how i said he never had any  pictures of her well he's got an entire  wall of pictures articles and  achievements down here that he's been  keeping track of her whole life and it  becomes apparent to her that yes her  father did abandon her but it was so he  could protect humanity from this  impending demonic invasion and not only  that he's rigged his entire home to be  one giant ghost trap and this giant  ghost trap is where the final act takes  us phoebe lures goes her to the farm in  an attempt to trap her but gozer gains  the upper hand and just as it looks like  humanity is doomed the original  ghostbusters arrive all dressed up in  their uniforms ready to bust some ghosts  earlier in the film phoebe called former  ghostbuster raymond stance asking for  his help but he didn't seem too keen on  helping in one of egon's crackpot  schemes especially since he abandoned  the other ghostbusters just like he did  his family but when he finds out this is  egon's granddaughter and the fate of the  world is at stake that might have  changed his decision but even the three  ghostbusters aren't strong enough to  take down gozer and only when phoebe  joins in with her gun with the help of  the ghost of egon that they're able to  spring the trap and contain gozer for  good now the ghost of egon doesn't have  any lines and that's because the actor  who played him harold ramis died back in  2014 but there are some really emotional  scenes where callie gets to finally hug  her father even if he's just a ghost  before the credits rule there's a nice  four herald dedication that plays now  the film does boast a mid and end credit  sequence the mid credits are mainly fan  service which sees bill murray's dr  peter venkman and sigourney weaver's  dana barrett recreate the esp shock test  from the original film it's never  explicitly stated whether the two are  married but they can be seen wearing  wedding bands it also takes place in a  home perhaps theirs and no sign of oscar  dana's son who is just a baby in  ghostbusters 2. in the films we never  find out who his father is then there  are the much juicier end credit scenes  which sees winston zedmore talking to  former ghostbusters secretary janine  malnets janine makes an appearance  earlier in the film showing cali the  farmstead and it's implied yet never  explicitly stated that she is cali's  mother this could be true considering  janine had eyes for egon in the first  film afterlife even shows a deleted  scene from the 1984 movie which sees  janine give egon a lucky coin if you  play the scene even further and  apologies for the quality here this is  what dr venkman has to say about their  relationship janine  didn't your mama ever tell you not to  get involved with no ghostbusters not go  on home as we continue we see winston  has turned into quite the businessman  amassing a large fortune with his  company he's even been paying the rent  for rey's bookshop this fortune looks  like it'll come in handy as winston can  be seen visiting the rundown  ghostbusters fire hall with someone  driving in the ecto-1 car so it looks as  though winston has bought the property  and is ready to bring the ghostbusters  back and this would probably be a new  generation of ghostbusters as this film  seems to be passing the baton the final  shot however is a bit more ominous the  camera focuses on the containment device  one that we've seen in the original  movie flashing red this is accompanied  by some fairly nefarious music  suggesting something's in there that  wants out so if they are setting us up  for a potential sequel it looks like it  will revolve around getting the  ghostbusters back up and running no word  yet if a sequel has been greenlit but i  want to know what you thought of  ghostbusters afterlife was the franchise  brought back from the dead or dead on  arrival i want to hear your thoughts in  the comments below thank you for  watching everyone be sure to like and  subscribe and for more bad takes you can  always follow me on twitter and  instagram at thingstoryt until next time  remember  daddy loves you very much  you
 

